10 0 obj
<</Dest[ 8 0 R /Fit]/Next 12 0 R /Parent 9 0 R /Title(Mr. Sonu Kumar, Director of SS Morsel India Pvt. Ltd., is the driving force behind the companys success and growth. With over 18+ years of extensive industry experience, he brings deep expertise in office furniture dismantling, bare shelling, and reinstatement services. His strong leadership, practical knowledge, and commitment to quality have helped the company deliver projects on time with exceptional performance. Under his guidance, SS Morsel India Pvt. Ltd. has built a reputation for reliability, professionalism, and client satisfaction. His vision and dedication continue to inspire the team and strengthen the companys position as a trusted name in the industry.)>>
endobj
